*.swo
.coverage

# Internal pre-release planning notes are excluded from the public snapshot.
/CODEX_PROMPT.md
/DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md
/SPECIFICATION.md
/docs/FIRST_RELEASE_DRAFT.md
/docs/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md

